Sun Oct 18 09:20:33 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.1.14
  * Native glTF 2.0 and 3D Tiles 1.0 support without external
    dependencies, incl. EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing and instancing
    of whole models via vsg::InstanceNode
  * Customizable Tile3D::Builder and extensible scene graph
    Builders for assimp, glTF and Tile3D; new shared_objects
    option
  * Optional meshoptimizer and mesh shader support; handle
    ASSIMP built with ASSIMP_DOUBLE_PRECISION
  * Improved color handling: color space controls, sRGB support
    in stbi/assimp loaders, sRGB assignment for diffuse and
    emissive textures
  * PBR/Phong shading detection from the AssImp shading model;
    DDS R16G16B16A16 and R32G32B32A32 float formats
  * KTX/DDS readers use vsg::MipmapLayout with libktx as
    external dependency; GDAL HTTP support and GDAL fixes
  * Compressed network transfers; optional texture embedding
- Drop 0001-Build-fixes-for-changes-to-GDAL-3.12.patch, applied
  upstream
- Soname bump 1 -> 3 (libvsgXchange1 becomes libvsgXchange3);
  require vsg >= 1.1.14
- Spec cleanup (drop Group tags and %defattr)

